                    %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
          %p
            In the course of these categorifications one usually finds that working
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internalization"} internal to
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Diff
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Diff
            is too restrictive for many purposes. Therefore higher Lie theory is often considered internal to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+smooth+space"} generalized smooth spaces
          %h2#lie_groupoids_versus_lie_algebroids Lie groupoids versus Lie algebroids
