            to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+algebroid"} Lie algebroids
          %p When it was found that Lie algebroids integrate to Lie groupoids by mapping paths into them, not only a “well known” but apparently also well forgotten way to integrate Lie algebras by means of paths was rediscovered, but also the idea to integrate higher Lie algebroids by mapping higher dimenmsional paths into them was clearly suggested.
